---
layout: null
sitemap: false
---
{% comment %}
  The retrieval section used to run on a hand-written sample: years, counts,
  works and titles were all synthesised, so searching it could not find a
  column entry that actually exists. This is the real archive, emitted once at
  build time and fetched by the homepage.

  It carries what makes a post findable without carrying its body: the title,
  the original entry title, the summary, the tags and the entity block. Body
  text stays with the site's lunr index at /search/, which already runs with
  search_full_content: true - duplicating it here would double the payload for
  the same answer.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign fam = "" %}
{"generated":"{{ site.time | date_to_xmlschema }}","items":[
{%- assign n = 0 -%}
{%- for post in site.posts -%}
  {%- case post.archive_type -%}
    {%- when "gamefreak_director_column" -%}{%- assign k = "gf" -%}{%- assign kind = "部长专栏" -%}
    {%- when "gamefreak_masuda_lineblog" -%}{%- assign k = "gf" -%}{%- assign kind = "增田顺一 LINE BLOG" -%}
    {%- when "gamefreak_legacy_blog" -%}{%- assign k = "gf" -%}
      {%- if post.gf_legacy_blog == "art" -%}{%- assign kind = "员工博客 · 美术" -%}
      {%- else -%}{%- assign kind = "员工博客" -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- when "scan_translation" -%}{%- assign k = "scan" -%}{%- assign kind = "扫描翻译" -%}
    {%- when "interview_translation" -%}{%- assign k = "scan" -%}{%- assign kind = "访谈翻译" -%}
    {%- else -%}{%- assign k = "article" -%}{%- assign kind = "自撰与整理" -%}
  {%- endcase -%}
  {%- if n > 0 %},{% endif -%}{%- assign n = n | plus: 1 %}
{"d":"{{ post.date | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}","k":"{{ k }}","kind":{{ kind | jsonify }},"u":"{{ post.url | relative_url }}","t":{{ post.title | jsonify }}
{%- if post.gf_entry_title %},"n":{{ post.gf_entry_title | jsonify }}{% endif -%}
{%- if post.summary %},"s":{{ post.summary | strip | jsonify }}{% endif -%}
{%- if post.tags and post.tags.size > 0 %},"g":{{ post.tags | jsonify }}{% endif -%}
{%- if post.entities.people and post.entities.people.size > 0 %},"p":{{ post.entities.people | jsonify }}{% endif -%}
{%- if post.entities.works and post.entities.works.size > 0 %},"w":{{ post.entities.works | jsonify }}{% endif -%}
{%- if post.entities.organizations and post.entities.organizations.size > 0 %},"o":{{ post.entities.organizations | jsonify }}{% endif -%}
{%- if post.entities.events and post.entities.events.size > 0 %},"v":{{ post.entities.events | jsonify }}{% endif -%}
}
{%- endfor %}
]}
